{"script":"yd_015_09","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1a","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":-120,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-474,"img":"chara015_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1a","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":-120,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-474,"img":"chara015_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]你问我穿的这身衣服？[r]这个……有时候是会比较热，不过大部分时候还好。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]这是我自己制作的套装，从护林人的标准装扮改版过来的。[r]而且我作为树冠守望者，穿得霸气些也很合理吧？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]全身被树叶和树皮覆盖，还有用骨制的装饰，连魔物远远看到我都会被吓到吧！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1f","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]什么？！你——你说你从远处看到的是一头可爱的小鹿？[r]还、还忍不住想去亲近？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]你这话也太羞人了！我可是在和你谈正经事呢……虽然好像也没那么正经……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]唔……感觉心跳很快很慌张……是刚刚喝掉的药水的原因吗……[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1f","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":-120,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-474,"img":"chara015_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"芭杜尔-亲密3"}